From 6e43507c96247caaecaba1aff96fec31b8c824ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luuk van Dijk <lvd@mndmttr.net>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 07:04:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(boards): add st/nucleo-f767zi

NuttX board target for the NUCLEO-F767ZI (no upstream target exists;
nearest relatives are the FMUv5/F765 boards). SPI3 sensor bus with
BMI088 accel/gyro and BMP388 baro on SPI, RM3100 mag, single CAN
(BOARD_UAVCAN_INTERFACES=1: the board wires only CAN1, and the
default of 2 costs every uavcan init a failed second-interface
bring-up), console + NSH on the ST-LINK VCP, CDC/ACM MAVLink. No SD
card; params live in internal flash (see the param backup fix).
